{"en":"<h2>Rule of the Khalifa Abdallahi</h2><p class=\"meta\">1885 CE – 1899 CE · Sudan – Middle Nile</p><p class=\"hwks\"><b>How we know:</b> <span><bdi>1</bdi> sources</span><span class=\"hwkk\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"hwkt\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-describedby=\"hwkd-en\">Evidence kinds (derived)</button><span class=\"hwtip\" role=\"tooltip\" id=\"hwkd-en\">from the data types present</span>:</span><span>written sources</span><span class=\"hwkv\" hidden></span></p><p class=\"chp\">Part of: <a href=\"/?era=mahdist-state-mahdiyya\">Mahdist State (Mahdiyya)</a></p><details open><summary>Key events</summary><ul><li>Khalifa Abdallahi presses the jihad against Egypt and Ethiopia <small class=\"kcites\"><a class=\"kcite\" href=\"https://unesdoc.unesco.org/ark:/48223/pf0000184296\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"H.A. Ibrahim (based on a contribution by Abbas I. Ali) · p.77\">source</a></small></li><li>Battle of Gallabat: Emperor Yohannes IV killed <small class=\"kcites\"><a class=\"kcite\" href=\"https://archive.org/details/fireswordinsuda00slat\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Rudolf C. Slatin (tr. F. R. Wingate) · 1896 · pp.440–441\">source</a></small></li><li>Battle of Toski: Mahdist invasion of Egypt defeated <small class=\"kcites\"><a class=\"kcite\" href=\"https://unesdoc.unesco.org/ark:/48223/pf0000184296\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"H.A. Ibrahim (based on a contribution by Abbas I. Ali) · p.77\">source</a></small></li><li>Uthman wad Adam&#x27;s emirs ravage Darfur <small class=\"kcites\"><a class=\"kcite\" href=\"https://archive.org/details/fireswordinsuda00slat\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Rudolf C. Slatin (tr. F. R. Wingate) · 1896 · p.442\">source</a></small></li><li>Osman Digna routed at Tokar <small class=\"kcites\"><a class=\"kcite\" href=\"https://archive.org/details/fireswordinsuda00slat\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Rudolf C. Slatin (tr. F. R. Wingate) · 1896 · p.474\">source</a></small></li><li>Battle of Agordat: Ahmed Wad Ali defeated and killed <small class=\"kcites\"><a class=\"kcite\" href=\"https://archive.org/details/fireswordinsuda00slat\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Rudolf C. Slatin (tr. F. R. Wingate) · 1896 · p.502\">source</a></small></li><li>Khalifa withdraws to Kordofan after Karari <small class=\"kcites\"><a class=\"kcite\" href=\"https://unesdoc.unesco.org/ark:/48223/pf0000184296\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"H.A. Ibrahim (based on a contribution by Abbas I. Ali) · p.78\">source</a></small></li><li>Battle of Umm Diwaykarat: death of the Khalifa <small class=\"kcites\"><a class=\"kcite\" href=\"https://unesdoc.unesco.org/ark:/48223/pf0000184296\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"H.A. Ibrahim (based on a contribution by Abbas I. Ali) · p.78\">source</a></small></li></ul></details><p class=\"srcs\"><small>Sources: <span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">GHA7_CH4 p.77; GHA7_CH4 p.78; SLATIN1896 p.442; SLATIN1896 p.474; SLATIN1896 p.502; SLATIN1896 pp.440–441</span></small></p><details><summary>Event images</summary><figure class=\"evf\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"320\" alt=\"Battle of Agordat: Ahmed Wad Ali defeated and killed\" src=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Special:FilePath/Alfred%20Pearse%20-%20Second%20Battle%20of%20Agordat%20%28Battles%20of%20the%20nineteenth%20century%2C%201901%29.jpg?width=320\"><figcaption><span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">Battle of Agordat: Ahmed Wad Ali defeated and killed</span><br><small>Alfred Pearse · Public domain · <a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Alfred_Pearse_-_Second_Battle_of_Agordat_(Battles_of_the_nineteenth_century,_1901).jpg\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Wikimedia Commons</a></small></figcaption></figure></details>","ar":"<h2>حكم الخليفة عبد الله <span class=\"vchip\" lang=\"ar\" aria-label=\"هذه المعلومة تحتاج إلى تحقق\">يحتاج تحقق</span></h2><p class=\"meta\">1885 م – 1899 م · السودان – النيل الأوسط</p><p class=\"hwks\"><b>كيف نعرف:</b> <span><bdi>1</bdi> مصادر</span><span class=\"hwkk\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"hwkt\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-describedby=\"hwkd-ar\">أنواع الأدلة (مستنتجة)</button><span class=\"hwtip\" role=\"tooltip\" id=\"hwkd-ar\">من أنواع البيانات الموجودة</span>:</span><span>مصادر مكتوبة</span><span class=\"hwkv\"><span class=\"vchip\">يحتاج تحقق</span> <bdi>9</bdi></span></p><p class=\"chp\">جزء من: <a href=\"/ar/?era=mahdist-state-mahdiyya\">الدولة المهدية</a></p><details open><summary>أحداث رئيسية</summary><ul><li>الخليفة عبد الله يمضي في الجهاد ضد مصر والحبشة <span class=\"vchip\" lang=\"ar\" aria-label=\"هذه المعلومة تحتاج إلى تحقق\">يحتاج تحقق</span> <small class=\"kcites\"><a class=\"kcite\" href=\"https://unesdoc.unesco.org/ark:/48223/pf0000184296\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"H.A. Ibrahim (based on a contribution by Abbas I. Ali) · p.77\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">المصدر</a></small></li><li>معركة القلابات: مقتل الإمبراطور يوحنا الرابع <span class=\"vchip\" lang=\"ar\" aria-label=\"هذه المعلومة تحتاج إلى تحقق\">يحتاج تحقق</span> <small class=\"kcites\"><a class=\"kcite\" href=\"https://archive.org/details/fireswordinsuda00slat\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Rudolf C. Slatin (tr. F. R. Wingate) · 1896 · pp.440–441\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">المصدر</a></small></li><li>معركة توشكي: هزيمة الغزو المهدي لمصر <span class=\"vchip\" lang=\"ar\" aria-label=\"هذه المعلومة تحتاج إلى تحقق\">يحتاج تحقق</span> <small class=\"kcites\"><a class=\"kcite\" href=\"https://unesdoc.unesco.org/ark:/48223/pf0000184296\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"H.A. Ibrahim (based on a contribution by Abbas I. Ali) · p.77\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">المصدر</a></small></li><li>أمراء عثمان ود آدم يعيثون في دارفور <span class=\"vchip\" lang=\"ar\" aria-label=\"هذه المعلومة تحتاج إلى تحقق\">يحتاج تحقق</span> <small class=\"kcites\"><a class=\"kcite\" href=\"https://archive.org/details/fireswordinsuda00slat\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Rudolf C. Slatin (tr. F. R. Wingate) · 1896 · p.442\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">المصدر</a></small></li><li>هزيمة عثمان دقنة في طوكر <span class=\"vchip\" lang=\"ar\" aria-label=\"هذه المعلومة تحتاج إلى تحقق\">يحتاج تحقق</span> <small class=\"kcites\"><a class=\"kcite\" href=\"https://archive.org/details/fireswordinsuda00slat\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Rudolf C. Slatin (tr. F. R. Wingate) · 1896 · p.474\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">المصدر</a></small></li><li>معركة أغوردات: هزيمة أحمد ود علي ومقتله <span class=\"vchip\" lang=\"ar\" aria-label=\"هذه المعلومة تحتاج إلى تحقق\">يحتاج تحقق</span> <small class=\"kcites\"><a class=\"kcite\" href=\"https://archive.org/details/fireswordinsuda00slat\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Rudolf C. Slatin (tr. F. R. Wingate) · 1896 · p.502\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">المصدر</a></small></li><li>انسحاب الخليفة إلى كردفان بعد كرري <span class=\"vchip\" lang=\"ar\" aria-label=\"هذه المعلومة تحتاج إلى تحقق\">يحتاج تحقق</span> <small class=\"kcites\"><a class=\"kcite\" href=\"https://unesdoc.unesco.org/ark:/48223/pf0000184296\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"H.A. Ibrahim (based on a contribution by Abbas I. Ali) · p.78\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">المصدر</a></small></li><li>معركة أم دبيكرات: مقتل الخليفة <span class=\"vchip\" lang=\"ar\" aria-label=\"هذه المعلومة تحتاج إلى تحقق\">يحتاج تحقق</span> <small class=\"kcites\"><a class=\"kcite\" href=\"https://unesdoc.unesco.org/ark:/48223/pf0000184296\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"H.A. Ibrahim (based on a contribution by Abbas I. Ali) · p.78\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">المصدر</a></small></li></ul></details><p class=\"srcs\"><small>المصادر: <span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">GHA7_CH4 p.77; GHA7_CH4 p.78; SLATIN1896 p.442; SLATIN1896 p.474; SLATIN1896 p.502; SLATIN1896 pp.440–441</span></small></p><details><summary>صور الأحداث</summary><figure class=\"evf\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"320\" alt=\"Battle of Agordat: Ahmed Wad Ali defeated and killed\" src=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Special:FilePath/Alfred%20Pearse%20-%20Second%20Battle%20of%20Agordat%20%28Battles%20of%20the%20nineteenth%20century%2C%201901%29.jpg?width=320\"><figcaption><span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">Battle of Agordat: Ahmed Wad Ali defeated and killed</span><br><small>Alfred Pearse · Public domain · <a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Alfred_Pearse_-_Second_Battle_of_Agordat_(Battles_of_the_nineteenth_century,_1901).jpg\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Wikimedia Commons</a></small></figcaption></figure></details>"}